&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Corps &#224; corps&lt;/b&gt; &#233;p&#233;e courte de ma&#238;tre, +7 (1d6+3/19-20) ou dague, +6 (1d4+4/19-20)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
